            <ArticleTitle>Spontaneous pain, hyperpathia and wasting of the hand due to parietal lobe haemorrhage.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A woman who had spontaneous pain, hyperpathia and wasting of her left hand due to a subcortical lesion in the right parietal lobe is reported. The presentation and evaluation of this most unusual case are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
